-foot><fn id="t1fn1"><label>&#x0002a;</label><p>Symbols recalled throughout the manuscript.</p></fn><fn id="t1fn2"><label>&#x02020;</label><p>Circulating plasma rapamycin concentration. EIR, exogenous insulin requirements; PRE, sample before rapamycin treatment; RAPA, sample during rapamycin treatment.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>